### Get all balances for emp-1
GET http://localhost:3000/balances/emp-1

### Get balances for emp-1 at a specific location
GET http://localhost:3000/balances/emp-1/loc-nyc

### Get balances for emp-2
GET http://localhost:3000/balances/emp-2

### Get balances for emp-3 (drift scenario)
GET http://localhost:3000/balances/emp-3

### Get balances for unknown employee — expects 404
GET http://localhost:3000/balances/unknown-emp

### Get balances for unknown location — expects 404
GET http://localhost:3000/balances/emp-1/unknown-loc
